    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Call for tenders – City of Belval Implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents City of Belval 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires compliance with regulatory requirements, including GDPR, and the solution must be designed as a tool of assistance, not automating decisions without explicit validation by an agent. the solution must be evaluated with regard to quality, relevance, compliance, security, cost, environmental issues, and innovation capacity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our current legal standing and contractual compliance, what are the potential risks and how can our ensure compliance with the potential risks?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our company context, our have experience with GDPR compliance, as indicated by our standard legal basis being Article 6(1)(e) – performance of task in public interest, and our data protection agreement template version is v3.2. our also have a no sensitive data processing default policy and provide DPIA support." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure compliance with The client requirements, our must guarantee strict compliance to GDPR. our has a policy of not processing sensitive data by default and provides support for Data Protection Impact Assessments (DPIA), which can help identify and mitigate potential risks. our also have experience with intra-EU operations, which simplifies our compliance with GDPR since our do not need to rely on Standard Contractual Clauses (SCCs) or adequacy decisions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding the design of the solution as a tool of assistance without automating decisions, our AI regulatory knowledge includes awareness of prohibited AI practices and limited-risk AI transparency obligations. our also have a policy of human oversight contractual enforcement and no automated decision-making without human validation, which aligns with the client's requirements for explicit validation by an agent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To mitigate potential risks, our must conduct thorough legal and financial due diligence on our subcontractors, ensuring our subcontractors comply with EU regulations, including GDPR. our subcontractor vetting process includes checking for exclusion grounds, which covers grave professional misconduct, conflicts of interest, and other relevant factors. our standard contractual clauses include a limitation of liability, professional indemnity insurance, cyber liability insurance, and performance bond capacity. a limitation of liability, professional indemnity insurance, cyber liability insurance, and performance bond capacity can help protect our against potential risks associated with non-compliance or data breaches." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of evaluation criteria, our has experience with public procurement in multiple EU jurisdictions, including France, where our are familiar with the French Code Commande Publique. our have also won a significant number of public contracts, demonstrating our ability to provide high-quality solutions that meet regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address environmental issues and innovation capacity, while address is not explicitly mentioned in our company context as a specific capability or policy, our can highlight our ability to optimize costs and provide innovative solutions through our experience with AI and digital transformation projects." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, without explicit information on environmental sustainability policies or practices within our company context, our must be cautious not to overcommit beyond what our can deliver based on the provided data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In conclusion, by leveraging our existing GDPR compliance measures, AI regulatory knowledge, subcontractor vetting processes, and contractual protections, our can mitigate potential risks and ensure compliance with the client's requirements regarding regulatory compliance, data protection, and solution design." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, for aspects like environmental sustainability, our need to be transparent about our capabilities and limitations based on the information available in our company context." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client has a global budget of 3 million euros over 4 years, with an annual cost of exploitation that must be compatible with the budgetary capacities of the local authority." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The offer must be evaluated with regard to the global cost of the proposed solution, taking into account environmental issues and innovation capacity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our current financial position and pricing model, what is our projected margin on this contract, and are there any cost-optimization strategies that our can propose?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our context, I can see that our target gross margin percentage is 28 percent, and our minimum acceptable margin percentage is 18 percent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To determine the projected margin, our need to know the revenue from this contract, which is not directly provided in the knowledge graph but our are given a global budget of 3 million euros over 4 years for The client." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assuming our can secure a global budget of 3 million euros over 4 years for the client as revenue for our, the annual revenue would be approximately 750,000 euros." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, I do not have information on the specific costs associated with this contract, such as labor, infrastructure, and other expenses that would determine the projected margin." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given pricing model includes a target gross margin of 28 percent, if our were to achieve a target gross margin of 28 percent on an annual revenue of 750,000 euros, our projected profit would be around 210,000 euros per year (28% of 750,000 euros)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "But without specific cost details, this remains a rough estimate." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For cost-optimization strategies, our company's context mentions that our can absorb a 10 percent budget reduction via rate renegotiation with subcontractors. absorb could potentially be proposed to the client as a way to optimize costs while maintaining our minimum acceptable margin percentage of 18 percent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Beyond this, without more specific details on the contract requirements and associated costs, it's challenging to propose detailed cost-optimization strategies that would align with both our target profitability and the client budgetary constraints." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents, with the ability to provide explanations for recommendations or proposals, and to demonstrate explainability and transparency." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must integrate with existing business software and rely on infrastructures with low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our current AI capabilities and innovation strategy, how can our design an AI component that meets these requirements and provides a competitive advantage?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet the client's requirements, our can leverage our expertise in explainability and transparency, as outlined in our company context, specifically the xai_methods which include Source citation, Chain-of-thought display, SHAP for classification models, and LIME. our can design an AI component that utilizes these methods to provide explanations for recommendations or proposals. our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, can be fine-tuned using our established fine-tuning methods such as LoRA, QLoRA, or Full fine-tune on domain corpus, to adapt to the client's specific needs and integrate with the client's existing business software." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This approach will enable our to provide a tailored solution that meets the client's requirements while minimizing environmental impact by relying on infrastructures with low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, our experience in deploying models such as Our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, LLaMA 3 8B, and CamemBERT, demonstrates our ability to work with large language models, which can be beneficial in providing accurate and informative explanations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By combining these capabilities with our expertise in RAG capabilities, including retrieval strategies and chunking strategies, our can develop a comprehensive AI component that not only provides explanations but also facilitates efficient information retrieval and processing." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of innovation strategy, our current research topics, such as knowledge graphs for procedural reasoning and multi-agent collaboration frameworks, can be leveraged to further enhance the AI component's capabilities and provide a competitive advantage." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It will have to be possible, a posteriori, to understand the elements having led to an answer or a suggestion. 4.3 Responsibility The expected solution will have to be designed as a tool of assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By integrating these emerging technologies into our solution, our can offer a unique and innovative approach that sets our apart from competitors." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, by combining our existing AI capabilities, expertise in explainability and transparency, and innovation strategy, our can design an AI component that meets the client's requirements, provides a competitive advantage, and contributes to reducing environmental impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires a solution that contributes to the reduction of energetic consumption and relies on infrastructures with low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The city of Belval has a policy of sustainable development and aims to limit The city of Belval environmental footprint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our current CSR and sustainability posture, how can our ensure that our proposed solution meets these requirements and supports the client's sustainability goals? our can ensure that our proposed solution meets the client's requirements by leveraging our existing capabilities in digital sobriety practices, such as INT8/INT4 model quantisation, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching, and green IT hardware procurement policy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "These practices have been estimated to reduce energy consumption by approximately 35% compared to our baseline." ;
